SIMPLE  =                    T / conforms to FITS standard                      BITPIX  =                  -64 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     NAXIS1  =                  844                                                  NAXIS2  =                  644                                                  DATE-OBS= '2017-10-13' /        YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss observation start, UT       TIME-OBS= '20:02:13' /          HH:MM:SS observation start time, UT             EXPTIME =   80.000000000000000 /Exposure time in seconds                        EXPOSURE=   80.000000000000000 /Exposure time in seconds                        SET-TEMP=  -20.000000000000000 /CCD temperature setpoint in C                   CCD-TEMP=  -9.6799997836351395 /CCD temperature at start of exposure in C       XPIXSZ  =   18.000000000000000 /Pixel Width in microns (after binning)          YPIXSZ  =   18.000000000000000 /Pixel Height in microns (after binning)         XBINNING=                    2 /Binning factor in width                         YBINNING=                    2 /Binning factor in height                        XORGSUBF=                  612 /Subframe X position in binned pixels            YORGSUBF=                  112 /Subframe Y position in binned pixels            IMAGETYP= 'Light Frame' /       Type of image                                   OBJCTRA = '20 14 17' /          Nominal Right Ascension of center of image      OBJCTDEC= '+65 13 32' /         Nominal Declination of center of image          OBJCTALT= ' 55.1502' /          Nominal altitude of center of image             OBJCTAZ = '329.8543' /          Nominal azimuth of center of image              OBJCTHA = '  2.8889' /          Nominal hour angle of center of image           SITELAT = '40 25 58' /          Latitude of the imaging location                SITELONG= '23 30 19' /          Longitude of the imaging location               